## User-specific Rider settings (.idea folder)
*.idea/**/workspace.xml
*.idea/**/tasks.xml
*.idea/**/usage.statistics.xml
*.idea/**/dictionaries
*.idea/**/shelf/
*.idea/**/contentModel.xml

## Rider sensitive and data sources
*.idea/**/dataSources/
*.idea/**/dataSources.ids
*.idea/**/dataSources.xml
*.idea/**/dataSources.local.xml
*.idea/**/sqlDataSources.xml
*.idea/**/dynamic.xml

## Rider Android / NuGet build artifacts
*.idea/**/*.iml
*.idea/**/modules.xml

## Note: Do NOT ignore the entire .idea folder if you want to share 
## your team run configurations (.idea/runConfigurations/) with others.

## .NET and C# build outputs
*bin/
*obj/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Visual Studio cache / temporary files
*.vs/

## Operating System files
*.DS_Store
*Thumbs.db
*Desktop.ini
